Third-party components
----------------------

This repository contains no third-party code or assets. The components below are installed by the package
manager (pnpm) at build time and are included in the built web UI (packages/ui/dist) or the api and worker
runtimes, under their own licenses. None of them ships a NOTICE file of its own; each one's full license text
is in its folder under node_modules after `pnpm install`.

Fonts served by the web UI, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org):
- Instrument Sans, Copyright 2022 The Instrument Sans Project Authors
  (https://github.com/Instrument/instrument-sans), via @fontsource-variable/instrument-sans
- JetBrains Mono, Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors
  (https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono), via @fontsource-variable/jetbrains-mono

Code parsing in the worker:
- web-tree-sitter, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2018 Max Brunsfeld
- @repomix/tree-sitter-wasms, The Unlicense: prebuilt WebAssembly builds of tree-sitter grammars. The worker
  loads those for TypeScript and TSX, JavaScript, Python, Go, Rust, C# (https://github.com/tree-sitter) and
  Swift (https://github.com/alex-pinkus/tree-sitter-swift), each under the MIT License of its authors.

Web UI bundle: React and React DOM (MIT), react-force-graph-2d, force-graph, kapsule, float-tooltip,
accessor-fn, canvas-color-tracker, index-array-by, jerrypick, d3-force-3d, d3-octree, d3-binarytree (MIT),
the d3 modules (ISC), preact, lodash-es, tinycolor2, bezier-js (MIT), Tailwind CSS (MIT).

api and worker: neo4j-driver (Apache-2.0), pg, pgvector, hono, @hono/node-server,
@modelcontextprotocol/sdk, zod (MIT).

Container images: the worker image installs the Claude Code CLI (@anthropic-ai/claude-code, under
Anthropic's own terms) and the Codex CLI (@openai/codex, Apache-2.0) when it is built. They are not part of
this repository, and the images are built on your machine.
